                      {
                        "durationMs": 2592000000
                      },
                      {
                        "durationMs": 5184000000
                      },
                      {
                        "durationMs": 7776000000
                      }
                    ],
                    "allowCustom": true
                  },
                  "label": "⏱️ Time Range"
                },
                {
                  "id": "c71f3009-a3f4-4aa5-aaf0-d0f667100e56",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "Help",
                  "label": "📖 Help",
                  "type": 10,
                  "description": "Show workbook help or change log information",
                  "isRequired": true,
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": [],
                    "showDefault": false
                  },
                  "jsonData": "[\r\n  { \"value\": \"Yes\", \"label\": \"Yes\" },\r\n  { \"value\": \"No\", \"label\": \"No\", \"selected\": true },\r\n  { \"value\": \"Change Log\", \"label\": \"Change Log\" }\r\n]"
                }
              ],
              "style": "above",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
            },
            "customWidth": "75",
            "name": "parameters - 1"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "# Change Log\r\n\r\n| Version | Changes |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| **v1.0** | Initial public preview of the **AI Governance** workbook. |\r\n| | Added configurable **Sanctioned AI Services** policy selection. |\r\n| | Added 🟢 **Sanctioned**, 🔴 **Unsanctioned**, and 🟠 **Mixed** governance classification. |\r\n| | Added consolidated **AI Compliance & Governance Review** covering browser, API/developer, non-browser network and desktop-client activity. |\r\n| | Added compact **Sanctioned and Unsanctioned AI Product** summaries based on distinct observed users. |\r\n| | Added **New AI Users** using a fixed 30-day observation window to identify users first observed during the most recent 7 days. |\r\n| | Added **Multi-AI Product Usage** across web and desktop-client activity. |\r\n| | Added **AI Agent / Tool Detection** using a public AI agent watchlist, including governance mapping and separate risk classification. |\r\n| | Added support for the workbook **Time Range** across applicable activity reports. |\r\n| | Designed as a lightweight, publicly shareable AI governance workbook using Microsoft Defender telemetry. |"
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "Help",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "Change Log"
            },
            "name": "text - 7"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "# 🤖 AI Governance\r\n\r\nThis workbook provides a high-level view of **AI usage observed through Microsoft Defender telemetry**, helping organisations understand which AI services and tools are being used and whether that activity aligns with approved AI policy.\r\n\r\n## 🟢 Sanctioned AI Services\r\n\r\nUse the **Sanctioned** selector to choose the AI products approved for use within your organisation.\r\n\r\nObserved activity is classified as:\r\n\r\n- 🟢 **Sanctioned** — activity associated with a selected approved AI service.\r\n- 🔴 **Unsanctioned** — activity associated with another recognised AI service.\r\n- 🟠 **Mixed** — a user has activity involving both sanctioned and unsanctioned AI products.\r\n- ⚪ **Not mapped to policy** — a detected AI agent or tool could not be reliably mapped to the product catalogue.\r\n\r\nIf no services are selected, all recognised AI activity is treated as **unsanctioned**.\r\n\r\n## 📊 Reports\r\n\r\n**AI Compliance & Governance Review** provides the main view of sanctioned and unsanctioned AI activity, including browser, API/developer, non-browser network and desktop-client evidence.\r\n\r\n**AI Product Summary** highlights sanctioned and unsanctioned AI products observed in the environment and the number of distinct users associated with each product.\r\n\r\n**New AI Users** identifies users first observed using AI within the last **7 days**, using a fixed **30-day observation window** to provide meaningful historical context.\r\n\r\n**Multi-AI Product Usage** identifies users accessing multiple AI products or providers and highlights whether their observed usage is sanctioned, unsanctioned or mixed.\r\n\r\n**AI Agent / Tool Detection** identifies known AI agents and agentic tools observed executing on endpoints. Governance status is shown where the tool can be mapped to the AI product catalogue; **Risk** is a separate watchlist assessment.\r\n\r\n## 🛡️ Microsoft Defender Data Requirements\r\n\r\nThe workbook primarily uses:\r\n\r\n- `DeviceNetworkEvents` — observed connections to recognised AI services.\r\n- `DeviceProcessEvents` — execution of recognised AI clients, agents and related processes.\r\n\r\nResults depend on Microsoft Defender licensing, endpoint onboarding, available telemetry and retention. Network activity indicates communication with an AI service but does **not** establish what information was submitted to that service.\r\n\r\n> **Tip:** Where the required Defender telemetry is not available through Microsoft Sentinel, try the workbook from **Microsoft Defender → Microsoft Sentinel → Workbooks**."
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "conditionalVisibility": {
              "parameterName": "Help",
              "comparison": "isEqualTo",
              "value": "Yes"
            },
            "name": "text - 7 - Copy"
          }
        ],
        "exportParameters": true
      },
      "name": "group - parameter and help"
    },
    {
      "type": 12,
      "content": {
        "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
        "groupType": "editable",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "> ### ⚙️ Configure Sanctioned AI Services\r\n>\r\n> **Before reviewing the governance results, select the AI products approved for use within your organisation from the dropdown below.**\r\n>\r\n> 🟢 **Sanctioned** — activity associated with services you have selected as approved.\r\n>\r\n> 🔴 **Unsanctioned** — activity associated with other recognised AI services.\r\n>\r\n> 🟠 **Mixed** — a user has been observed using both sanctioned and unsanctioned AI products.\r\n>\r\n> ⚠️ **If no services are selected, all recognised AI activity will be classified as unsanctioned.**\r\n\r\nThe workbook primarily uses:\r\n**DeviceNetworkEvents** — observed connections to recognised AI services.\r\n**DeviceProcessEvents** — execution of recognised AI clients, agents and related processes."
            },
            "name": "text - 4"
          },
          {
            "type": 9,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "parameters": [
                {
                  "id": "c85479ea-0dba-47b1-b8a9-1cdfca44e527",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "Sanctioned",
                  "type": 2,
                  "description": "Is this product Sanctioned True/False?",
                  "multiSelect": true,
                  "quote": "'",
                  "delimiter": ",",
                  "query": "let AIDomainData = externaldata(\r\n    Provider:string,\r\n    Product:string,\r\n    Domain:string,\r\n    Category:string,\r\n    Sanctioned:bool,\r\n    RiskType:string,\r\n    SourceURL:string,\r\n    ProcessName:string,\r\n    ProcessProductName:string,\r\n    ProcessPublisher:string\r\n)\r\n[\r\n    @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_domains_expanded.csv\"\r\n]\r\nwith (\r\n    format=\"csv\",\r\n    ignoreFirstRecord=true\r\n);\r\nAIDomainData\r\n| where isnotempty(Domain)\r\n| extend Label=strcat(Provider, \" - \", Product, \" (\", Domain, \")\")\r\n| distinct Value=Domain, Label\r\n| order by Label asc",
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "{ws}"
                  ],
                  "typeSettings": {
                    "additionalResourceOptions": []
                  },
                  "timeContext": {
                    "durationMs": 0
                  },
                  "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
                  "queryType": 0,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
                  "value": [
                    "copilot.microsoft.com"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "9a001a37-7139-4634-a72e-212b99ce5704",
                  "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
                  "name": "SanctionedCount",
                  "type": 1,
                  "query": "resources\r\n| take 1\r\n| project SanctionedCount =\r\n    iff(\r\n        isempty(\"{Sanctioned}\"),\r\n        0,\r\n        array_length(split(\"{Sanctioned}\", \",\"))\r\n    )",
                  "crossComponentResources": [
                    "value::all"
                  ],
                  "isHiddenWhenLocked": true,
                  "queryType": 1,
                  "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
                }
              ],
              "style": "above",
              "queryType": 1,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.resourcegraph/resources"
            },
            "name": "parameters - 11"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\r\n// AI GOVERNANCE AT A GLANCE\r\n//\r\n// High-level public governance summary.\r\n//\r\n// Uses:\r\n//   - Workbook TimeRange\r\n//   - Customer-selected {Sanctioned} services\r\n//   - Network activity\r\n//   - Desktop client activity\r\n//\r\n// Output:\r\n//   One row per headline metric for tile visualisation.\r\n// ============================================================\r\n\r\n\r\n// ============================================================\r\n// AI SERVICE CATALOGUE\r\n// ============================================================\r\n\r\nlet AIData = externaldata(\r\n    Provider:string,\r\n    Product:string,\r\n    Domain:string,\r\n    Category:string,\r\n    Sanctioned:bool,\r\n    RiskType:string,\r\n    SourceURL:string,\r\n    ProcessName:string,\r\n    ProcessProductName:string,\r\n    ProcessPublisher:string\r\n)\r\n[\r\n    @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_domains_expanded.csv\"\r\n]\r\nwith (\r\n    format=\"csv\",\r\n    ignoreFirstRecord=true\r\n);\r\n\r\n\r\n// ============================================================\r\n// KNOWN AI DOMAINS\r\n// ============================================================\r\n\r\nlet AIDomains = toscalar(\r\n    AIData\r\n    | where isnotempty(Domain)\r\n    | summarize make_set(Domain)\r\n);\r\n\r\n\r\n// ============================================================\r\n// CUSTOMER-SELECTED SANCTIONED SERVICES\r\n// ============================================================\r\n\r\nlet SanctionedDomains =\r\n    dynamic([{Sanctioned}]);\r\n\r\n\r\n// ============================================================\r\n// NETWORK ACTIVITY\r\n// ============================================================\r\n\r\nlet NetworkActivity =\r\n    DeviceNetworkEvents\r\n\r\n    | where Timestamp between ({TimeRange:start} .. {TimeRange:end})\r\n\r\n    | where isnotempty(InitiatingProcessAccountUpn)\r\n\r\n    | where isnotempty(RemoteUrl)\r\n\r\n    | where RemoteUrl has_any (AIDomains)\r\n\r\n    | project\r\n        User = InitiatingProcessAccountUpn,\r\n        RemoteUrl\r\n\r\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\r\n\r\n    | join kind=inner (\r\n        AIData\r\n        | where isnotempty(Domain)\r\n        | distinct\r\n            Provider,\r\n            Product,\r\n            Domain\r\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\r\n    ) on JoinKey\r\n\r\n    | where RemoteUrl has Domain\r\n\r\n    | extend IsSanctioned =\r\n        array_length(SanctionedDomains) > 0\r\n        and SanctionedDomains has Domain\r\n\r\n    | project\r\n        User,\r\n        Provider,\r\n        Product,\r\n        Domain,\r\n        IsSanctioned;\r\n\r\n\r\n// ============================================================\r\n// DESKTOP CLIENT CATALOGUE\r\n// ============================================================\r\n\r\nlet AIProcesses =\r\n    AIData\r\n\r\n    | where isnotempty(ProcessName)\r\n        or isnotempty(ProcessProductName)\r\n        or isnotempty(ProcessPublisher)\r\n\r\n    | project\r\n        Provider,\r\n        Product,\r\n        Domain,\r\n        CatalogueProcessName = ProcessName,\r\n        CatalogueProductName = ProcessProductName,\r\n        CataloguePublisher = ProcessPublisher;\r\n\r\n\r\n// ============================================================\r\n// DESKTOP CLIENT ACTIVITY\r\n// ============================================================\r\n\r\nlet DesktopActivity =\r\n    DeviceProcessEvents\r\n\r\n    | where Timestamp between ({TimeRange:start} .. {TimeRange:end})\r\n\r\n    | where isnotempty(AccountUpn)\r\n\r\n    | extend\r\n        ProcessNameLower =\r\n            tolower(FileName),\r\n\r\n        ProductNameLower =\r\n            tolower(ProcessVersionInfoProductName),\r\n\r\n        PublisherLower =\r\n            tolower(ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName)\r\n\r\n    | join kind=inner (\r\n        AIProcesses\r\n\r\n        | extend\r\n            ProcessNameLower =\r\n                tolower(CatalogueProcessName),\r\n\r\n            CatalogueProductNameLower =\r\n                tolower(CatalogueProductName),\r\n\r\n            CataloguePublisherLower =\r\n                tolower(CataloguePublisher)\r\n\r\n    ) on ProcessNameLower\r\n\r\n    | where\r\n        isempty(CatalogueProductName)\r\n        or ProductNameLower == CatalogueProductNameLower\r\n        or isempty(ProcessVersionInfoProductName)\r\n\r\n    | where\r\n        isempty(CataloguePublisher)\r\n        or PublisherLower has CataloguePublisherLower\r\n        or isempty(ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName)\r\n\r\n    | extend IsSanctioned =\r\n        array_length(SanctionedDomains) > 0\r\n        and SanctionedDomains has Domain\r\n\r\n    | project\r\n        User = AccountUpn,\r\n        Provider,\r\n        Product,\r\n        Domain,\r\n        IsSanctioned;\r\n\r\n\r\n// ============================================================\r\n// COMBINE AND DEDUPLICATE\r\n//\r\n// One row per user/product/policy state.\r\n// This prevents network event volume from affecting the\r\n// governance headline metrics.\r\n// ============================================================\r\n\r\nlet AIUsage =\r\n    union\r\n        NetworkActivity,\r\n        DesktopActivity\r\n\r\n    | where isnotempty(User)\r\n\r\n    | summarize\r\n        IsSanctioned = max(IsSanctioned)\r\n      by\r\n        User,\r\n        Provider,\r\n        Product,\r\n        Domain;\r\n\r\n\r\n// ============================================================\r\n// USER GOVERNANCE\r\n// ============================================================\r\n\r\nlet UserGovernance =\r\n    AIUsage\r\n\r\n    | summarize\r\n\r\n        SanctionedProducts =\r\n            dcountif(\r\n                Product,\r\n                IsSanctioned\r\n            ),\r\n\r\n        UnsanctionedProducts =\r\n            dcountif(\r\n                Product,\r\n                not(IsSanctioned)\r\n            )\r\n\r\n      by User\r\n\r\n    | extend Governance =\r\n        case(\r\n            SanctionedProducts > 0\r\n                and UnsanctionedProducts > 0,\r\n                \"Mixed\",\r\n\r\n            UnsanctionedProducts > 0,\r\n                \"Unsanctioned only\",\r\n\r\n            SanctionedProducts > 0,\r\n                \"Sanctioned only\",\r\n\r\n            \"Review\"\r\n        );\r\n\r\n\r\n// ============================================================\r\n// HEADLINE VALUES\r\n// ============================================================\r\n\r\nlet TotalUsers =\r\n    toscalar(\r\n        UserGovernance\r\n        | summarize count()\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet TotalProducts =\r\n    toscalar(\r\n        AIUsage\r\n        | summarize dcount(Product)\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet UnsanctionedUsers =\r\n    toscalar(\r\n        UserGovernance\r\n        | where Governance == \"Unsanctioned only\"\r\n        | summarize count()\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet MixedUsers =\r\n    toscalar(\r\n        UserGovernance\r\n        | where Governance == \"Mixed\"\r\n        | summarize count()\r\n    );\r\n\r\nlet SanctionedUsers =\r\n    toscalar(\r\n        UserGovernance\r\n        | where Governance == \"Sanctioned only\"\r\n        | summarize count()\r\n    );\r\n\r\n\r\n// ============================================================\r\n// TILE OUTPUT\r\n// ============================================================\r\n\r\nunion\r\n    (\r\n        print\r\n            SortOrder = 1,\r\n            Metric = \"👥 AI Users Observed\",\r\n            Value = tolong(TotalUsers)\r\n    ),\r\n    (\r\n        print\r\n            SortOrder = 2,\r\n            Metric = \"🤖 AI Products Observed\",\r\n            Value = tolong(TotalProducts)\r\n    ),\r\n    (\r\n        print\r\n            SortOrder = 3,\r\n            Metric = \"🔴 Unsanctioned-only Users\",\r\n            Value = tolong(UnsanctionedUsers)\r\n    ),\r\n    (\r\n        print\r\n            SortOrder = 4,\r\n            Metric = \"🟠 Mixed Users\",\r\n            Value = tolong(MixedUsers)\r\n    ),\r\n    (\r\n        print\r\n            SortOrder = 5,\r\n            Metric = \"🟢 Sanctioned-only Users\",\r\n            Value = tolong(SanctionedUsers)\r\n    )\r\n\r\n| order by SortOrder asc\r\n\r\n| project\r\n    Metric,\r\n    Value",
              "size": 4,
              "title": "📊 AI Governance at a Glance",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "showBorder": false,
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Metric",
                  "formatter": 1
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Value",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "auto"
                  },
                  "numberFormat": {
                    "unit": 17,
                    "options": {
                      "maximumSignificantDigits": 3,
                      "maximumFractionDigits": 2
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "name": "query - 12"
          },
          {
            "type": 1,
            "content": {
              "json": "This report provides a consolidated view of **AI usage observed across users and devices**, classifying activity as either 🟢 **Sanctioned** or 🔴 **Unsanctioned** based on the AI services selected as approved above. Activity is further separated by how the service was accessed: **Web / Browser** for browser-based use, **API / Developer** for developer or API services, **Non-browser Network** for AI network connections originating from other processes, and **Desktop Client** for known AI applications observed executing on endpoints. Use the grouped results and column filters to identify unsanctioned AI adoption, understand how approved services are being consumed, and investigate the supporting users, devices, processes, URLs, and execution evidence. Results reflect activity within the selected **Time Range**."
            },
            "name": "text - 22"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\r\n// Unsanctioned AI Products Observed - Tile Summary\r\n// ============================================================\r\n\r\nlet AIDomainData = externaldata(\r\n    Provider:string,\r\n    Product:string,\r\n    Domain:string,\r\n    Category:string,\r\n    Sanctioned:bool,\r\n    RiskType:string,\r\n    SourceURL:string,\r\n    ProcessName:string,\r\n    ProcessProductName:string,\r\n    ProcessPublisher:string\r\n)\r\n[\r\n    @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_domains_expanded.csv\"\r\n]\r\nwith (\r\n    format=\"csv\",\r\n    ignoreFirstRecord=true\r\n);\r\n\r\nlet AIDomains = toscalar(\r\n    AIDomainData\r\n    | where isnotempty(Domain)\r\n    | summarize make_set(Domain)\r\n);\r\n\r\nlet SanctionedDomains = dynamic([{Sanctioned}]);\r\n\r\nlet Browsers = dynamic([\r\n    \"msedge.exe\",\r\n    \"chrome.exe\",\r\n    \"firefox.exe\",\r\n    \"brave.exe\",\r\n    \"opera.exe\",\r\n    \"iexplore.exe\"\r\n]);\r\n\r\nlet NetworkActivity =\r\n    DeviceNetworkEvents\r\n    | where Timestamp between ({TimeRange:start} .. {TimeRange:end})\r\n    | where isnotempty(InitiatingProcessAccountUpn)\r\n    | where isnotempty(RemoteUrl)\r\n    | where RemoteUrl has_any (AIDomains)\r\n    | project\r\n        Timestamp,\r\n        User = InitiatingProcessAccountUpn,\r\n        DeviceId,\r\n        DeviceName,\r\n        RemoteUrl,\r\n        Process = InitiatingProcessFileName\r\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\r\n    | join kind=inner (\r\n        AIDomainData\r\n        | where isnotempty(Domain)\r\n        | distinct Provider, Product, Domain, Category, RiskType\r\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\r\n    ) on JoinKey\r\n    | where RemoteUrl has Domain\r\n    | extend IsSanctioned =\r\n        array_length(SanctionedDomains) > 0\r\n        and SanctionedDomains has Domain\r\n    | extend IsBrowser = Process in~ (Browsers)\r\n    | extend IsAPI =\r\n        RiskType =~ \"API\"\r\n        or Category =~ \"API\"\r\n        or Product has \"API\"\r\n    | extend IsDeveloper =\r\n        RiskType =~ \"Developer\"\r\n        or Category =~ \"Developer\"\r\n    | extend AccessType =\r\n        case(\r\n            IsBrowser, \"Web / Browser\",\r\n            IsAPI or IsDeveloper, \"API / Developer\",\r\n            \"Non-browser Network\"\r\n        )\r\n    | where not(IsSanctioned)\r\n    | project\r\n        Timestamp,\r\n        Provider,\r\n        Product,\r\n        Domain,\r\n        User,\r\n        DeviceId,\r\n        DeviceName,\r\n        AccessType;\r\n\r\nlet AIProcesses =\r\n    AIDomainData\r\n    | where isnotempty(ProcessName)\r\n        or isnotempty(ProcessProductName)\r\n        or isnotempty(ProcessPublisher)\r\n    | project\r\n        Provider,\r\n        Product,\r\n        Domain,\r\n        CatalogueProcessName = ProcessName,\r\n        CatalogueProductName = ProcessProductName,\r\n        CataloguePublisher = ProcessPublisher;\r\n\r\nlet DesktopActivity =\r\n    DeviceProcessEvents\r\n    | where Timestamp between ({TimeRange:start} .. {TimeRange:end})\r\n    | where isnotempty(AccountUpn)\r\n    | extend\r\n        ProcessNameLower = tolower(FileName),\r\n        ProductNameLower = tolower(ProcessVersionInfoProductName),\r\n        PublisherLower = tolower(ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName)\r\n    | join kind=inner (\r\n        AIProcesses\r\n        | extend\r\n            ProcessNameLower = tolower(CatalogueProcessName),\r\n            CatalogueProductNameLower = tolower(CatalogueProductName),\r\n            CataloguePublisherLower = tolower(CataloguePublisher)\r\n    ) on ProcessNameLower\r\n    | where\r\n        isempty(CatalogueProductName)\r\n        or ProductNameLower == CatalogueProductNameLower\r\n        or isempty(ProcessVersionInfoProductName)\r\n    | where\r\n        isempty(CataloguePublisher)\r\n        or PublisherLower has CataloguePublisherLower\r\n        or isempty(ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName)\r\n    | extend IsSanctioned =\r\n        array_length(SanctionedDomains) > 0\r\n        and SanctionedDomains has Domain\r\n    | where not(IsSanctioned)\r\n    | extend AccessType = \"Desktop Client\"\r\n    | project\r\n        Timestamp,\r\n        Provider,\r\n        Product,\r\n        Domain,\r\n        User = AccountUpn,\r\n        DeviceId,\r\n        DeviceName,\r\n        AccessType;\r\n\r\nunion NetworkActivity, DesktopActivity\r\n| summarize\r\n    Users = dcount(User),\r\n    Devices = dcount(DeviceId),\r\n    Activity = count(),\r\n    AccessTypes = make_set(AccessType, 10),\r\n    UserList = make_set(User, 20),\r\n    DeviceList = make_set(DeviceName, 20),\r\n    FirstSeen = min(Timestamp),\r\n    LastSeen = max(Timestamp)\r\n  by Provider, Product, Domain\r\n| extend ProductTitle = strcat(Provider, \" - \", Product)\r\n| order by Users desc, Activity desc\r\n| project\r\n    ProductTitle,\r\n    Users,\r\n    Provider,\r\n    Product,\r\n    Domain,\r\n    Devices,\r\n    Activity,\r\n    AccessTypes,\r\n    LastSeen,\r\n    FirstSeen,\r\n    UserList,\r\n    DeviceList",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🔴 Unsanctioned AI Products Observed — {$rowCount}",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "ProductTitle"
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Users",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "auto"
                  },
                  "numberFormat": {
                    "unit": 17,
                    "options": {
                      "maximumSignificantDigits": 3,
                      "maximumFractionDigits": 0
                    }
                  }
                },
                "showBorder": false
              }
            },
            "customWidth": "50",
            "name": "query - Unsanctioned AI Product Tiles"
          },
          {
            "type": 3,
            "content": {
              "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
              "query": "// ============================================================\r\n// Sanctioned AI Products Observed - Tile Summary\r\n// ============================================================\r\n\r\nlet AIDomainData = externaldata(\r\n    Provider:string,\r\n    Product:string,\r\n    Domain:string,\r\n    Category:string,\r\n    Sanctioned:bool,\r\n    RiskType:string,\r\n    SourceURL:string,\r\n    ProcessName:string,\r\n    ProcessProductName:string,\r\n    ProcessPublisher:string\r\n)\r\n[\r\n    @\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/quorumcyber-workbooks/workbooks/main/Files/QCDataTypes/ai_domains_expanded.csv\"\r\n]\r\nwith (\r\n    format=\"csv\",\r\n    ignoreFirstRecord=true\r\n);\r\n\r\nlet AIDomains = toscalar(\r\n    AIDomainData\r\n    | where isnotempty(Domain)\r\n    | summarize make_set(Domain)\r\n);\r\n\r\nlet SanctionedDomains = dynamic([{Sanctioned}]);\r\n\r\nlet Browsers = dynamic([\r\n    \"msedge.exe\",\r\n    \"chrome.exe\",\r\n    \"firefox.exe\",\r\n    \"brave.exe\",\r\n    \"opera.exe\",\r\n    \"iexplore.exe\"\r\n]);\r\n\r\nlet NetworkActivity =\r\n    DeviceNetworkEvents\r\n    | where Timestamp between ({TimeRange:start} .. {TimeRange:end})\r\n    | where isnotempty(InitiatingProcessAccountUpn)\r\n    | where isnotempty(RemoteUrl)\r\n    | where RemoteUrl has_any (AIDomains)\r\n    | project\r\n        Timestamp,\r\n        User = InitiatingProcessAccountUpn,\r\n        DeviceId,\r\n        DeviceName,\r\n        RemoteUrl,\r\n        Process = InitiatingProcessFileName\r\n    | extend JoinKey = 1\r\n    | join kind=inner (\r\n        AIDomainData\r\n        | where isnotempty(Domain)\r\n        | distinct Provider, Product, Domain, Category, RiskType\r\n        | extend JoinKey = 1\r\n    ) on JoinKey\r\n    | where RemoteUrl has Domain\r\n    | extend IsSanctioned =\r\n        array_length(SanctionedDomains) > 0\r\n        and SanctionedDomains has Domain\r\n    | extend IsBrowser = Process in~ (Browsers)\r\n    | extend IsAPI =\r\n        RiskType =~ \"API\"\r\n        or Category =~ \"API\"\r\n        or Product has \"API\"\r\n    | extend IsDeveloper =\r\n        RiskType =~ \"Developer\"\r\n        or Category =~ \"Developer\"\r\n    | extend AccessType =\r\n        case(\r\n            IsBrowser, \"Web / Browser\",\r\n            IsAPI or IsDeveloper, \"API / Developer\",\r\n            \"Non-browser Network\"\r\n        )\r\n    | where IsSanctioned\r\n    | project\r\n        Timestamp,\r\n        Provider,\r\n        Product,\r\n        Domain,\r\n        User,\r\n        DeviceId,\r\n        DeviceName,\r\n        AccessType;\r\n\r\nlet AIProcesses =\r\n    AIDomainData\r\n    | where isnotempty(ProcessName)\r\n        or isnotempty(ProcessProductName)\r\n        or isnotempty(ProcessPublisher)\r\n    | project\r\n        Provider,\r\n        Product,\r\n        Domain,\r\n        CatalogueProcessName = ProcessName,\r\n        CatalogueProductName = ProcessProductName,\r\n        CataloguePublisher = ProcessPublisher;\r\n\r\nlet DesktopActivity =\r\n    DeviceProcessEvents\r\n    | where Timestamp between ({TimeRange:start} .. {TimeRange:end})\r\n    | where isnotempty(AccountUpn)\r\n    | extend\r\n        ProcessNameLower = tolower(FileName),\r\n        ProductNameLower = tolower(ProcessVersionInfoProductName),\r\n        PublisherLower = tolower(ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName)\r\n    | join kind=inner (\r\n        AIProcesses\r\n        | extend\r\n            ProcessNameLower = tolower(CatalogueProcessName),\r\n            CatalogueProductNameLower = tolower(CatalogueProductName),\r\n            CataloguePublisherLower = tolower(CataloguePublisher)\r\n    ) on ProcessNameLower\r\n    | where\r\n        isempty(CatalogueProductName)\r\n        or ProductNameLower == CatalogueProductNameLower\r\n        or isempty(ProcessVersionInfoProductName)\r\n    | where\r\n        isempty(CataloguePublisher)\r\n        or PublisherLower has CataloguePublisherLower\r\n        or isempty(ProcessVersionInfoCompanyName)\r\n    | extend IsSanctioned =\r\n        array_length(SanctionedDomains) > 0\r\n        and SanctionedDomains has Domain\r\n    | where IsSanctioned\r\n    | extend AccessType = \"Desktop Client\"\r\n    | project\r\n        Timestamp,\r\n        Provider,\r\n        Product,\r\n        Domain,\r\n        User = AccountUpn,\r\n        DeviceId,\r\n        DeviceName,\r\n        AccessType;\r\n\r\nunion NetworkActivity, DesktopActivity\r\n| summarize\r\n    Users = dcount(User),\r\n    Devices = dcount(DeviceId),\r\n    Activity = count(),\r\n    AccessTypes = make_set(AccessType, 10),\r\n    UserList = make_set(User, 20),\r\n    DeviceList = make_set(DeviceName, 20),\r\n    FirstSeen = min(Timestamp),\r\n    LastSeen = max(Timestamp)\r\n  by Provider, Product, Domain\r\n| extend ProductTitle = strcat(Provider, \" - \", Product)\r\n| order by Users desc, Activity desc\r\n| project\r\n    ProductTitle,\r\n    Users,\r\n    Provider,\r\n    Product,\r\n    Domain,\r\n    Devices,\r\n    Activity,\r\n    AccessTypes,\r\n    LastSeen,\r\n    FirstSeen,\r\n    UserList,\r\n    DeviceList",
              "size": 0,
              "title": "🟢 Sanctioned AI Products Observed — {$rowCount}",
              "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
              "queryType": 0,
              "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
              "crossComponentResources": [
                "{ws}"
              ],
              "visualization": "tiles",
              "tileSettings": {
                "titleContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "ProductTitle"
                },
                "leftContent": {
                  "columnMatch": "Users",
                  "formatter": 12,
                  "formatOptions": {
                    "palette": "auto"
                  },
                  "numberFormat": {
